{"parse":{"title":"Cook's Assistant","pageid":2088,"revid":15375073,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"noexcerpt noprint nomobile navigation-not-searchable rs-external-header-links\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"rs-header-icon rs-header-icon-rs\" data-interwiki=\"rsw\" data-page=\"Cook&#39;s Assistant\" data-wikiname=\"The RuneScape Wiki\">Cook's Assistant</span><span class=\"rs-header-icon rs-header-icon-rsc\" data-interwiki=\"classicrsw\" data-page=\"Cook&#39;s assistant\" data-wikiname=\"The RuneScape Classic Wiki\">Cook's assistant</span><span class=\"rs-header-icon rs-header-icon-dw\" data-interwiki=\"rsdww\" data-page=\"Cook&#39;s Assistant\" data-wikiname=\"The RuneScape: Dragonwilds Wiki\">Cook's Assistant</span></div>\n<table class=\"messagebox\" role=\"presentation\">\n<tbody><tr><td class=\"messagebox-image\" style=\"width: 50px;\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"/images/Instruction_manual.png?13f14\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"28\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"28\" data-file-height=\"27\" /></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><span class=\"messagebox-title\"><b>This quest has a <a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant/Quick_guide\" title=\"Cook&#39;s Assistant/Quick guide\">quick guide</a>&#160;and a <a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant/Speedrun_guide\" title=\"Cook&#39;s Assistant/Speedrun guide\">speedrunning guide</a>.</b></span><br style=\"clear: both;\" /><div style=\"font-size:0.85em; line-height:1.4em;\" class=\"messagebox-text\">It briefly summarises the steps needed to complete the quest.\n</div></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"infobox no-parenthesis-style infobox-quest\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"infobox-header\" colspan=\"5\">Cook's Assistant&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">(#1)</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"infobox-image infobox-full-width-content\" colspan=\"5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Cook%27s_Assistant.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Cook%27s_Assistant.png/300px-Cook%27s_Assistant.png?2e488\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"228\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/Cook%27s_Assistant.png?2e488 2x\" data-file-width=\"406\" data-file-height=\"309\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"infobox-padding\" colspan=\"5\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Released\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/4_January\" title=\"4 January\">4 January</a> <a href=\"/w/2001\" title=\"2001\">2001</a> (<a href=\"/w/Update:Runescape_beta_is_now_online!\" title=\"Update:Runescape beta is now online!\">Update</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Members\" title=\"Members\">Members</a>\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\">No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Quest_series\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quest series\">Quest series</a>\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Lead developer(s)\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Paul_Gower\" title=\"Paul Gower\">Paul Gower</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"infobox-padding\" colspan=\"5\">\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Cook's Assistant</b> is the first <i><a href=\"/w/Old_School_RuneScape\" title=\"Old School RuneScape\">RuneScape</a></i> <a href=\"/w/Quests\" title=\"Quests\">quest</a> ever released and one of the six quests available during the game's launch. In the quest, the player must help the <a href=\"/w/Cook_(Lumbridge)\" title=\"Cook (Lumbridge)\">cook</a> of <a href=\"/w/Lumbridge_Castle\" title=\"Lumbridge Castle\">Lumbridge Castle</a> make a birthday <a href=\"/w/Cake\" title=\"Cake\">cake</a> for <a href=\"/w/Duke_Horacio\" title=\"Duke Horacio\">Duke Horacio</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Details\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Details</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#A_feast_for_a_Duke\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">A feast for a Duke</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Bucket_and_pot\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bucket and pot</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Egg\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Egg</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Bucket_of_milk\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bucket of milk</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Pot_of_flour\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pot of flour</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Delivery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Delivery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Rewards\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rewards</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Required_for_completing\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Required for completing</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Transcript\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Transcript</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Changes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Changes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Details\">Details</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Details\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Details\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"questdetails\" cellspacing=\"3\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Start point</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Map icon\"><img alt=\"Map icon\" src=\"/images/Quest_point_icon.png?dc356\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"21\" data-file-height=\"21\" /></span></span> Talk to the <a href=\"/w/Cook_(Lumbridge)\" title=\"Cook (Lumbridge)\">Cook</a> in the kitchen of <a href=\"/w/Lumbridge_Castle\" title=\"Lumbridge Castle\">Lumbridge Castle</a>. <a class=\"mw-kartographer-maplink\" data-mw-kartographer=\"\" data-zoom=\"2\" data-lat=\"3216\" data-lon=\"3208\" data-mapid=\"-1\" data-plane=\"0\" data-overlays=\"[&quot;pins&quot;]\"><b>Show on map</b></a></td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Official difficulty</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\"><a href=\"/w/Quests/Novice\" title=\"Quests/Novice\">Novice</a></td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Official length</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\">Very Short</td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Description</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\">The Lumbridge Castle cook is in a mess. It is the Duke of Lumbridge's birthday and the cook is making the cake.\nHe needs a lot of ingredients and doesn't have much time.</td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Requirements</th><td class=\"questdetails-info qc-input qc-active\">\nNone</td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Items required</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\">\n<div class=\"lighttable checklist no-toggle-parent\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Egg\" title=\"Egg\">Egg</a> (can be obtained during the quest)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Bucket_of_milk\" title=\"Bucket of milk\">Bucket of milk</a>\n<ul><li>A <a href=\"/w/Bucket\" title=\"Bucket\">bucket</a> (if obtaining the milk during the quest)</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Pot_of_flour\" title=\"Pot of flour\">Pot of flour</a>\n<ul><li>A <a href=\"/w/Pot\" title=\"Pot\">pot</a> (if obtaining the flour during the quest)</li></ul></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><th class=\"questdetails-header\">Enemies to defeat</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\">\nNone</td></tr><tr class=\"leagues-global-flag\"><th class=\"questdetails-header\"><a href=\"/w/Demonic_Pacts_League\" title=\"Demonic Pacts League\">League</a> notes</th><td class=\"questdetails-info\"><div class=\"poem\">\n<p>Unlocking <span class=\"league-region\" data-league-area=\"asgarnia\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Demonic_Pacts_League/Areas/Asgarnia\" title=\"Asgarnia\"><img alt=\"Asgarnia\" src=\"/images/Asgarnia_Area_Badge.png?4ec29\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"30\" /></a></span> <span class=\"league-name\"><a href=\"/w/Demonic_Pacts_League/Areas/Asgarnia\" title=\"Demonic Pacts League/Areas/Asgarnia\">Asgarnia</a></span><span class=\"league-check\">✓</span></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/Yes_check.svg?4e3f5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"11\" data-file-height=\"11\" /></span></span> will auto-complete the quest<br />\nUnlocking <span class=\"league-region\" data-league-area=\"kandarin\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Demonic_Pacts_League/Areas/Kandarin\" title=\"Kandarin\"><img alt=\"Kandarin\" src=\"/images/Kandarin_Area_Badge.png?f8338\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"30\" /></a></span> <span class=\"league-name\"><a href=\"/w/Demonic_Pacts_League/Areas/Kandarin\" title=\"Demonic Pacts League/Areas/Kandarin\">Kandarin</a></span><span class=\"league-check\">✓</span></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/Yes_check.svg?4e3f5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"11\" data-file-height=\"11\" /></span></span> will auto-complete the quest\n</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Walkthrough\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>This quest is typically among the first to be completed by new players and is intended to encourage exploration of <a href=\"/w/Lumbridge\" title=\"Lumbridge\">Lumbridge</a>. However, for non <a href=\"/w/Ironmen\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ironmen\">Ironmen</a> players, it is possible to skip gathering the ingredients yourself by purchasing the items on the <a href=\"/w/Grand_Exchange\" title=\"Grand Exchange\">Grand Exchange</a> before speaking to the <a href=\"/w/Cook_(Lumbridge)\" title=\"Cook (Lumbridge)\">Cook</a>, allowing for the quest to be completed in seconds.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"A_feast_for_a_Duke\">A feast for a Duke</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: A feast for a Duke\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: A feast for a Duke\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/w/File:Cook_(Lumbridge)_chathead.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/Cook_%28Lumbridge%29_chathead.png?75d24\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"82\" height=\"131\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"82\" data-file-height=\"131\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Begin the quest by speaking with the Lumbridge <a href=\"/w/Cook_(Lumbridge)\" title=\"Cook (Lumbridge)\">cook</a> found in the kitchen on the <span class=\"floornumber\"><span class=\"floornumber-gb\">ground&#160;floor<sup class=\"floornumber-help noexcerpt\">&#91;<span class=\"fact-text floor-convention\" title=\"British convention; floor 1 in the US\">UK</span>&#93;</sup></span><span class=\"floornumber-us noexcerpt\">1<sup class=\"floornumber-ordinal-suffix\">st</sup>&#160;floor<sup class=\"floornumber-help noexcerpt\">&#91;<span class=\"fact-text floor-convention\" title=\"US convention; ground floor in the UK\">US</span>&#93;</sup></span></span> of <a href=\"/w/Lumbridge_Castle\" title=\"Lumbridge Castle\">Lumbridge Castle</a>. He mentions it is <a href=\"/w/Duke_Horacio\" title=\"Duke Horacio\">Duke Horacio</a>'s birthday and that he is supposed to bake the Duke a <a href=\"/w/Cake\" title=\"Cake\">cake</a>. Unfortunately, however, he has forgotten to buy the ingredients and asks the player to bring him a <a href=\"/w/Bucket_of_milk\" title=\"Bucket of milk\">bucket of milk</a>, an <a href=\"/w/Egg\" title=\"Egg\">egg</a>, and a <a href=\"/w/Pot_of_flour\" title=\"Pot of flour\">pot of flour</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Bucket_and_pot\">Bucket and pot</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Bucket and pot\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Bucket and pot\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A <a href=\"/w/Bucket\" title=\"Bucket\">bucket</a> spawns in the cellar of Lumbridge Castle, and a <a href=\"/w/Pot\" title=\"Pot\">pot</a> spawns in the kitchen on the centre table. You can also purchase both a bucket and a pot from the <a href=\"/w/Lumbridge_General_Store\" title=\"Lumbridge General Store\">Lumbridge General Store</a> for <span class=\"coins coins-pos\">2</span> and <span class=\"coins coins-pos\">1</span> <a href=\"/w/Coins\" title=\"Coins\">coins</a>, respectively.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Egg\">Egg</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Egg\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Egg\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-kartographer-container thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><a class=\"mw-kartographer-map\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 300px;background-image: url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-10-07_a/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_48_52.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-10-07_a/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_49_52.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-10-07_a/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_50_52.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-10-07_a/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_48_51.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-10-07_a/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_49_51.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-10-07_a/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_50_51.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-10-07_a/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_48_50.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-10-07_a/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_49_50.png), url(https://maps.runescape.wiki/osrs/versions/2026-10-07_a/tiles/rendered/0/2/0_50_50.png); background-position: -226px -246px, 30px -246px, 286px -246px, -226px 10px, 30px 10px, 286px 10px, -226px 266px, 30px 266px, 286px 266px; background-repeat: no-repeat;\" data-mw-kartographer=\"\" data-width=\"300\" data-height=\"300\" data-zoom=\"2\" data-lat=\"3293\" data-lon=\"3166\" data-mapid=\"0\" data-plane=\"0\" data-overlays=\"[&quot;pins&quot;]\"></a><div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div style=\"margin:0px -3px 0px -3px\"><div style=\"font:bold 12px IBM Plex Sans;align-content:center;text-align:center;background:var(--body-dark);min-height:20px;width:100%\">Ingredient locations</div><ul style=\"display:flex;margin:unset;flex-flow:row wrap\"><li style=\"padding:3px 0px;display:flex;flex:1 1 100%;min-height:20px;width:auto\"><div style=\"margin-right:5px;min-width:22px;border-right:2px inset var(--body-dark);text-align:center;padding:0px 4px 0px 4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;align-content:center\"><div style=\"margin:auto;height:16px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid black;width:16px;background:red\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-right:4px;align-content:center;padding-left:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:100%\">Chicken coop</div></li><li style=\"padding:3px 0px;display:flex;flex:1 1 100%;min-height:20px;width:auto\"><div style=\"margin-right:5px;min-width:22px;border-right:2px inset var(--body-dark);text-align:center;padding:0px 4px 0px 4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;align-content:center\"><div style=\"margin:auto;height:16px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid black;width:16px;background:blue\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-right:4px;align-content:center;padding-left:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:100%\">Dairy cow field</div></li><li style=\"padding:3px 0px;display:flex;flex:1 1 100%;min-height:20px;width:auto\"><div style=\"margin-right:5px;min-width:22px;border-right:2px inset var(--body-dark);text-align:center;padding:0px 4px 0px 4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;align-content:center\"><div style=\"margin:auto;height:16px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid black;width:16px;background:yellow\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-right:4px;align-content:center;padding-left:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;width:100%\">Wheat field</div></li></ul></div></div></div></div>\n<p>Go east out of <a href=\"/w/Lumbridge_Castle\" title=\"Lumbridge Castle\">Lumbridge Castle</a> and run north along the path until you reach the <a href=\"/w/Chicken\" title=\"Chicken\">chicken</a> <a href=\"/w/Coop\" title=\"Coop\">coop</a> north-west of <a href=\"/w/Fred_the_Farmer\" title=\"Fred the Farmer\">Farmer Fred</a>'s house. Go into the coop and pick up an <a href=\"/w/Egg\" title=\"Egg\">egg</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Bucket_of_milk\">Bucket of milk</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=6&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Bucket of milk\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Bucket of milk\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>With an empty <a href=\"/w/Bucket\" title=\"Bucket\">bucket</a>, go north into the <a href=\"/w/Cow\" title=\"Cow\">cow</a> pasture. Use the empty bucket on a <a href=\"/w/Dairy_cow\" title=\"Dairy cow\">dairy cow</a> (distinguishable by its cowbell) to get a <a href=\"/w/Bucket_of_milk\" title=\"Bucket of milk\">bucket of milk</a>. You can optionally talk to <a href=\"/w/Gillie_Groats\" title=\"Gillie Groats\">Gillie Groats</a> for an explanation on how to milk a cow. She can be found across the <a href=\"/w/River_Lum\" title=\"River Lum\">river</a> next to the dairy cow in the eastern <a href=\"/w/Lumbridge_cow_field\" title=\"Lumbridge cow field\">Lumbridge cow field</a>.\n</p><p>The cook will also accept milk that is in a <a href=\"/w/Bottomless_bucket_of_milk\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bottomless bucket of milk\">bottomless bucket of milk</a>, taking one bucket worth of milk from it.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Pot_of_flour\">Pot of flour</h4><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=7&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Pot of flour\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Pot of flour\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>With an empty <a href=\"/w/Pot\" title=\"Pot\">pot</a>, leave the cow pasture and go south-west to the wheat field. Pick some <a href=\"/w/Grain\" title=\"Grain\">grain</a>, and then enter the <a href=\"/w/Mill_Lane_Mill\" title=\"Mill Lane Mill\">Mill Lane Mill</a>, found up the road to the north-east. Climb to the top floor, put the grain in the hopper, then pull the lever and climb back down to the <span class=\"floornumber\"><span class=\"floornumber-gb\">ground&#160;floor<sup class=\"floornumber-help noexcerpt\">&#91;<span class=\"fact-text floor-convention\" title=\"British convention; floor 1 in the US\">UK</span>&#93;</sup></span><span class=\"floornumber-us noexcerpt\">1<sup class=\"floornumber-ordinal-suffix\">st</sup>&#160;floor<sup class=\"floornumber-help noexcerpt\">&#91;<span class=\"fact-text floor-convention\" title=\"US convention; ground floor in the UK\">US</span>&#93;</sup></span></span>. Finally, use an empty pot on the <a href=\"/w/Flour_bin\" title=\"Flour bin\">flour bin</a> (which is now full of flour) to get a <a href=\"/w/Pot_of_flour\" title=\"Pot of flour\">pot of flour</a>. You can optionally talk to <a href=\"/w/Millie_Miller\" title=\"Millie Miller\">Millie Miller</a> inside the mill for an explanation on how to make <a href=\"/w/Pot_of_flour\" title=\"Pot of flour\">flour</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Delivery\">Delivery</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=8&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Delivery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Delivery\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>After collecting the ingredients, speak to the <a href=\"/w/Cook_(Lumbridge)\" title=\"Cook (Lumbridge)\">cook</a> to deliver them.\n</p><p><b>Congratulations, quest complete!</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"clear-template clear-both\" style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=9&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Rewards\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Rewards\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Cook%27s_Assistant_reward_scroll.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/Cook%27s_Assistant_reward_scroll.png?69721\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"488\" height=\"320\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"488\" data-file-height=\"320\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li>1 <span class=\"scp\" data-skill=\"Quest points\" style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;height:1em;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Quest_points\" title=\"Quest points\"><img alt=\"Quest points\" src=\"/images/Quest_point_icon.png?dc356\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"21\" data-file-height=\"21\" /></a></span> </span> <a href=\"/w/Quest_points\" title=\"Quest points\">Quest point</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"scp\" data-skill=\"Cooking\" data-level=\"300\" style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;height:1em;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"><img alt=\"Cooking\" src=\"/images/Cooking_icon.png?a0156\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"19\" data-file-height=\"21\" /></a></span> 300 <a href=\"/w/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\">Cooking</a></span> <a href=\"/w/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">experience</a></li>\n<li>Permission to use the <a href=\"/w/Cooking_range_(Lumbridge_Castle)\" title=\"Cooking range (Lumbridge Castle)\">Cook-o-matic 100</a>, which reduces the chance of burning some <a href=\"/w/Food\" title=\"Food\">foods</a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Required_for_completing\">Required for completing</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=10&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Required for completing\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Required for completing\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The completion of Cook's Assistant is a requirement to complete the following:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Recipe_for_Disaster\" title=\"Recipe for Disaster\">Recipe for Disaster</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Easy_Lumbridge_%26_Draynor_Diary\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Easy Lumbridge &amp; Draynor Diary\">Easy Lumbridge &amp; Draynor Diary</a>: <i>Bake some bread on the Lumbridge castle kitchen range.</i></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Transcript\">Transcript</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=11&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Transcript\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Transcript\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"messagebox hasdialogue\" style=\"border: 0;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"center\">This article on a quest has an associated dialogue page.<br /><b><a href=\"/w/Transcript:Cook%27s_Assistant\" title=\"Transcript:Cook&#39;s Assistant\">Click here</a></b> for a transcript of possible conversations encountered throughout the quest.<br /><b><a href=\"/w/Transcript:Cook%27s_Assistant/Journal\" title=\"Transcript:Cook&#39;s Assistant/Journal\">Click here</a></b> for a transcript of the quest's journal entry.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Changes\">Changes</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=12&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Changes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Changes\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible sortable\" style=\"max-width:800px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Date\n</th>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Changes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-sort-value=\"14 January 2026\"><a href=\"/w/14_January\" title=\"14 January\">14&#160;January</a>&#160;<a href=\"/w/2026\" title=\"2026\">2026</a><br />(<a href=\"/w/Update:New_Player_Improvements_Round_2\" title=\"Update:New Player Improvements Round 2\">Update</a>)\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>The quest's journal entry was updated to make it more intuitive.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-sort-value=\"14 May 2020\"><a href=\"/w/14_May\" title=\"14 May\">14&#160;May</a>&#160;<a href=\"/w/2020\" title=\"2020\">2020</a><br />(<a href=\"/w/Update:Bounty_Hunter_Feedback_Changes\" title=\"Update:Bounty Hunter Feedback Changes\">Update</a>)\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>All of the free-to-play quest journals have been updated to be more informative.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-sort-value=\"8 August 2019\"><a href=\"/w/8_August\" title=\"8 August\">8&#160;August</a>&#160;<a href=\"/w/2019\" title=\"2019\">2019</a><br />(<a href=\"/w/Update:Smithing_and_Silver_Crafting_Interfaces\" title=\"Update:Smithing and Silver Crafting Interfaces\">Update</a>)\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>The dialogue in the Cook's Assistant quest, text in the quests log, and windmills have been updated to be more informative and to have improved usability.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-sort-value=\"2 August 2018\"><a href=\"/w/2_August\" title=\"2 August\">2&#160;August</a>&#160;<a href=\"/w/2018\" title=\"2018\">2018</a><br />(<a href=\"/w/Update:Tournament_World,_Mobile_Enhancements_and_Theatre_of_Blood_Tweaks\" title=\"Update:Tournament World, Mobile Enhancements and Theatre of Blood Tweaks\">Update</a>)\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Cooks Assistant, Sheep Shearer and Imp Catcher will now recognise that you have the items required to complete the quest upon starting each of them.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?section=13&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant?action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/w/Death_to_the_Dorgeshuun\" title=\"Death to the Dorgeshuun\">Death to the Dorgeshuun</a> quest, when you introduce <a href=\"/w/Zanik\" title=\"Zanik\">Zanik</a> to the <a href=\"/w/Cook_(Lumbridge)\" title=\"Cook (Lumbridge)\">cook</a>, he tries to offer the quest to her, saying, \"In fact, it's a good thing I met you. It's the Duke's birthday today, and I should be making him a lovely big birthday cake. I need eggs, flour, and milk...\" The player then tells the cook that Zanik does not have time for that, to which he responds, \"It was worth a try.\" This insinuates that the cook asks all newcomers to bring him supplies.</li>\n<li>During the <a href=\"/w/20th_Anniversary_event\" title=\"20th Anniversary event\">20th Anniversary event</a>, it was revealed that the cook has attempted and failed to bake a cake countless times, explaining his recurring need for ingredients from new adventurers.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/w/Cook_(servant)\" title=\"Cook (servant)\">cook</a> at the <a href=\"/w/Servants%27_Guild\" title=\"Servants&#39; Guild\">Servants' Guild</a> of <a href=\"/w/Ardougne\" title=\"Ardougne\">Ardougne</a> references this quest in her dialogue, saying, \"Overnight I was fired and replaced by some fool who can't even bake a cake without help!\"</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox navigation-not-searchable hlist nowraplinks &lt;mw:editsection mw-collapsible mw-collapsed navbox-autocollapse\" data-navbox-name=\"Cook&#39;s Assistant\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><div style=\"float:left;text-align:left\"><div class=\"navbar inline plainlinks hlist noprint navbar-mini\" style=\"font-weight:normal;font-size:x-small;white-space:nowrap;\"><ul><li><a href=\"/w/Template:Cook%27s_Assistant\" title=\"Template:Cook&#39;s Assistant\"><span title=\"View this template\" style=\"\">v</span></a></li><li class=\"autoconfirmed-show\" style=\"display:none\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Template_talk:Cook%27s_Assistant\"><span title=\"Discussion about this template\" style=\"\">t</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/w/Special:EditPage/Template:Cook%27s_Assistant\" title=\"Special:EditPage/Template:Cook&#39;s Assistant\"><span title=\"Edit this template\" style=\"\">e</span></a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"navbox-title-name\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Cook's Assistant</a></div></th></tr><tr class=\"navbox-group\"><th class=\"navbox-group-title\">NPCs</th><td class=\"navbox-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"plink-template\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Cook_(Lumbridge)\" title=\"Cook (Lumbridge)\"><img alt=\"Chathead image of Cook (Lumbridge)\" src=\"/images/thumb/Cook_%28Lumbridge%29_chathead.png/22px-Cook_%28Lumbridge%29_chathead.png?75d24\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Cook_%28Lumbridge%29_chathead.png/44px-Cook_%28Lumbridge%29_chathead.png?75d24 2x\" data-file-width=\"82\" data-file-height=\"131\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/w/Cook_(Lumbridge)\" title=\"Cook (Lumbridge)\">Cook</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"plink-template\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Gillie_Groats\" title=\"Gillie Groats\"><img alt=\"Chathead image of Gillie Groats\" src=\"/images/thumb/Gillie_Groats_chathead.png/30px-Gillie_Groats_chathead.png?7eecc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Gillie_Groats_chathead.png/60px-Gillie_Groats_chathead.png?7eecc 2x\" data-file-width=\"70\" data-file-height=\"81\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/w/Gillie_Groats\" title=\"Gillie Groats\">Gillie Groats</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"plink-template\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Millie_Miller\" title=\"Millie Miller\"><img alt=\"Chathead image of Millie Miller\" src=\"/images/thumb/Millie_Miller_chathead.png/35px-Millie_Miller_chathead.png?c04f6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Millie_Miller_chathead.png/70px-Millie_Miller_chathead.png?c04f6 2x\" data-file-width=\"92\" data-file-height=\"81\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/w/Millie_Miller\" title=\"Millie Miller\">Millie Miller</a></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-group\"><th class=\"navbox-group-title\">Items</th><td class=\"navbox-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"plink-template\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Bucket_of_milk\" title=\"Bucket of milk\"><img src=\"/images/Bucket_of_milk.png?c50c3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"29\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/w/Bucket_of_milk\" title=\"Bucket of milk\">Bucket of milk</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"plink-template\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Egg\" title=\"Egg\"><img src=\"/images/Egg.png?0a875\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/w/Egg\" title=\"Egg\">Egg</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"plink-template\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Pot_of_flour\" title=\"Pot of flour\"><img src=\"/images/Pot_of_flour.png?bbceb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"26\" data-file-height=\"28\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/w/Pot_of_flour\" title=\"Pot of flour\">Pot of flour</a></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-group\"><th class=\"navbox-group-title\">Reward</th><td class=\"navbox-list\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Cooking_range_(Lumbridge_Castle)\" title=\"Cooking range (Lumbridge Castle)\">Cook-o-matic 100</a></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-group\"><th class=\"navbox-group-title\">Locations</th><td class=\"navbox-list\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Lumbridge_Castle\" title=\"Lumbridge Castle\">Lumbridge Castle</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Lumbridge_cow_field\" title=\"Lumbridge cow field\">Lumbridge cow field</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Mill_Lane_Mill\" title=\"Mill Lane Mill\">Mill Lane Mill</a></li></ul></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-group\"><th class=\"navbox-group-title\">Related</th><td class=\"navbox-list\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant/Quick_guide\" title=\"Cook&#39;s Assistant/Quick guide\">Quick guide</a> <sup>(<a href=\"/w/Cook%27s_Assistant/Speedrun_guide\" title=\"Cook&#39;s Assistant/Speedrun guide\">speedrunning</a>)</sup></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Transcript:Cook%27s_Assistant\" title=\"Transcript:Cook&#39;s Assistant\">Transcript</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/Transcript:Cook%27s_Assistant/Journal\" title=\"Transcript:Cook&#39;s Assistant/Journal\">Journal</a></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐6f9587545d‐kmbtg\nCached time: 20261018145619\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 930/1000000\nRevision size: 6737/8388608 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 27881/8388608 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3180/8388608 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4963/5000000 bytes\nBucket time usage: 0.000/10 seconds\nLua time usage: 0.016/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1084175/367001600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.896      1 -total\n 25.51%   12.728      1 Template:Quest_details\n 17.20%    8.581      1 Template:Map\n 13.32%    6.647      1 Template:Cook&#039;s_Assistant\n 10.24%    5.110      1 Template:External\n  9.73%    4.853      1 Template:Navbox\n  5.76%    2.875      1 Template:Mapkey\n  5.25%    2.619      4 Template:Subject_changes\n  4.94%    2.465      2 Template:FloorNumber\n  4.37%    2.182      1 Template:Quest_rewards\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_osrswiki:pcache:2088:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018145731 and revision id 15375073. Rendering was triggered because: page-edit\n -->\n</div>","jsconfigvars":{"wgKartographerLiveData":{"pins":[{"features":[{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"coordinates":[3208.5,3214.5],"type":"Point"},"properties":{"mapID":-1,"providerID":0,"description":"<p style=\"font-size:10px; margin:0px;\">X/Y: 3208,3214</p>","group":"pins","title":"Start point","plane":0,"icon":"greenPin"}}],"type":"FeatureCollection"},{"features":[{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"coordinates":[3181